This story is a work of fiction.

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:37.450
September, 1589 - Sagami Province - Odawara Castle

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:37.380
How does it look? I, Hōjō Ujinao, am not well versed in the way of the tea. My abilities may be lacking.

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:40.780
You may be the head of Sagami Province.

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:44.650
The only worthy item you have is the Karma Pot.

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:52.980
I am really sorry, but Lord Ujinao, you are not an aesthete in my eyes.

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:07.740
You're quite blunt.

00:03:08.210 --> 00:03:15.000
You have the ability to speak frankly.
Is that what all Kamakura warriors from the past are like?

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:18.680
You fit right in here at Sagami.

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:22.290
I want to let that foolish fake Hideyoshi hear these words.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.930
Well, I'm learning from you, too.

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:30.000
I shall not bow down to Hideyoshi.

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:34.890
If he comes at us at full force, then I will respond as necessary.

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:38.900
Well said, milord!

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:42.010
We are with you all the way!

00:03:48.350 --> 00:03:50.900
Furuta Oribe and Fires

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:56.140
I'll leave aesthetics to you, Sōji.

00:03:56.550 --> 00:03:59.780
Sagami is great at metal casting. They also have excellent painters.

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:04.010
Please help them in making famed treasures.

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:11.960
Why...

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:14.270
Why do I feel such gratitude?

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:18.540
I was always hated by warriors.

00:04:19.850 --> 00:04:23.560
They don't shave their heads or hold any pretenses.

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:26.820
They have no famed treasures and are behind the times.

00:04:32.010 --> 00:04:33.440
But those eyes...

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:42.730
I am enthralled by those eyes, chasing after the essence of imperfection.

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:56.020
I always thought I couldn't see eye to eye with men of war.

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:58.670
I was too narrowminded.

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:03.730
Even without famed treasures, they possess something else.

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:08.610
I have received their heart and intent to chase after simplicity.

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:21.090
How prejudiced I used to be...

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:26.570
November, 1589 - Kyoto - Daitoku Temple

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:30.140
You beautifully merged the three doors into two stories.

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:35.230
I, Kokei, am eternally thankful.

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:43.420
I shall name it Kinmō Pavilion.

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:46.080
What's the origin of that name?

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:48.750
Kinmō as referring to a lion.

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:56.510
A lion lying in wait can leap higher than any tower. A Buddist idiom.

00:05:57.570 --> 00:06:02.390
The name is fitting for a famous man like you, Master Rikyū.

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:07.380
I built this door in remembrance of my late father, who passed fifty years ago.

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:09.240
No, no.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:17.360
I was able to return from Kyushu because of your tireless efforts.

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:23.150
I asked the Chief Advisor when he was in a good mood.

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:24.430
I was fortunate.

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:32.880
I want to put a wooden statue and a ceiling painting of you in the pavilion.

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:36.040
That is going too far.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:38.560
Don't say that.

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:42.040
The painting will be by a painter recommended by Lord Furuori.

00:06:42.450 --> 00:06:44.780
Let's go and take a look.

00:06:47.390 --> 00:06:49.930
Long time no see, Master Rikyū.

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:54.250
Thank you for giving me, Hasegawa Tōhaku, this fabulous opportunity!

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:58.790
I will make you a legend!

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:05.570
I have a request.

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:06.950
What is it?

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:11.180
Please do not stray too far from the normal.

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.330
My dear, it is time.

00:07:26.810 --> 00:07:30.620
I may be sending you off to Kyoto as a hostage,

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:35.060
but we're going to be able to live together again. I'm grateful for that.

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:37.190
Please don't worry about me too much.

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:43.580
The Chief Advisor's wife is a very kind lady.

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:48.400
But now you are going to attack Odawara, right after the new year.

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:51.200
I worry about you.

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:54.230
Don't you worry.

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:59.270
My libido has been coming back to me.

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:03.050
December, 1589 - Kyoto - Jurakudai - Tokugawa Residence 

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:06.920
A war with Hōjō is inevitable.

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:10.000
We move out on February of the next year.

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:15.700
Before then, in order to strenghten the relationship between the Tokugawa and Hideyoshi families,

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:22.800
the Chief Advisor's adopted daughter Kohime will marry my son, Nagamaru.

00:08:23.430 --> 00:08:24.470
Lord Hosokawa.

00:08:24.740 --> 00:08:29.860
Please teach the proper mannerisms of the ceremony to Nagamaru.

00:08:30.390 --> 00:08:34.060
Lord Furuta, this is the first time my son has gone to the capital.

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:36.460
Please guide him well.

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:40.530
Thank you very much.

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:44.140
Please be strict in your teachings.

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:49.300
I have to attend a meeting now, so I'll take my leave.

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:59.760
How old are you, Nagamaru?

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:00.990
Ten.

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:05.120
The Chief Advisor gave me the name Hide. 

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:08.430
Please call me Hidetada.

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:10.260
Lord Hidetada, eh?

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:14.760
What a cool-sounding warrior name.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:26.090
This is something from me.

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:29.070
Please pick one for yourself.

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:35.700
I will come back later and take the one you don't want.

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:38.120
If you are having trouble picking, then feel free to talk to me.

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:46.350
He'll probably pick the one with a bump in the middle, right?

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:49.790
We'll see from his choice whether he has the heart of an aesthete.

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:54.780
Lord Hidetada has a heavy burden on his shoulders.

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:59.130
If he can learn the ways of an aesthete, he can live an easier life in Kyoto.

00:09:59.850 --> 00:10:04.150
So he won't go out of control in public, right?

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:22.620
January, 1590 - Yamato Province - Kōriyama Castle 

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:33.180
The Emperor sent this, his own unique medicine from the Ming dynasty.

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:36.980
Get well soon and attack Odawara with me.

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:40.890
Thank you so much, my dear brother.

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:46.520
Thank goodness Osu is doing well.

00:10:47.150 --> 00:10:51.180
Even without me here, the Toyotomi clan is stable.

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:52.850
Don't say that.

00:10:54.430 --> 00:10:56.900
Our bodies have always been weak.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:04.800
My younger sister Asahi died from sickness, and my mother is sick in bed. Now you too...

00:11:09.220 --> 00:11:14.220
I have renamed Osu to Tsurumatsu to stop the fate of this lineage.

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:18.070
If you're thinking about the future of the Toyotomi clan,

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:21.320
then you must not let go of Master Rikyū.

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:27.920
Various daimyo sent him letters of thanks through me.

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:33.020
That means many of them still trusts Master Rikyū.

00:11:34.490 --> 00:11:39.020
We cannot underestiimate the power of imperfection.

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:44.190
I heard Yamanoue Sōji is at Odawara.

00:11:44.730 --> 00:11:49.430
That man is the second most important man that the Toyotomi clan needs.

00:11:50.150 --> 00:11:55.930
It would be smart to have him around after the war.

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:01.550
We lack in the number of successors.

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:03.310
Sorry for worrying you.

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:06.010
But everything's fine now.

00:12:06.860 --> 00:12:09.720
I can still produce heirs.

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:21.800
I must find nice women other than Chacha.

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:31.720
I'm sure that's Master Rikyū's daughter, Ogin.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:41.000
W-What a beauty.

00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:47.180
January, 1590 - Kyoto -   Temple - Construction Grounds

00:12:55.150 --> 00:12:59.620
Is this Master Rikyū's house of simplicity?

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:05.920
Two studies as well as a tea room as big as two tatami mats further in the back.

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:13.850
I am able to finish this before our war with Odawara thanks to Lord Ueda porcuring the lumbar.

00:13:14.970 --> 00:13:21.020
It's as if Buddha himself threw down two huge dice.

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:33.810
I've heard that building a hilly residence in the city is pushing the limits of being an aesthete.

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:37.980
And yet you have pushed the boundaries once again.

00:13:38.070 --> 00:13:40.980
This is beyond what Lord Furuta is capable of.

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:51.940
I never realized Master Rikyū, a man well versed in simplicity, is such a monster.

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:57.380
There is still some time until Hōkō Temple is finished.

00:13:57.830 --> 00:14:03.310
I am looking forward to the comparisons between the temple and this room of simplicity.

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:07.850
I can't be losing to Lord Furuori just yet.

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:10.310
Laugh and run with it.

00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:23.980
Aren't you taking a look inside, Lord Ishida?

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:28.820
He is making light of the main construction efforts.

00:14:29.530 --> 00:14:34.020
And now he creates a monstrosity that stands out more than the Buddha room. What hubris.

00:14:35.420 --> 00:14:38.570
You will be punished one day.

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:42.350
I got had!

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:49.040
He has boiled simplicity down to its core essense!

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:52.520
Just like how that golden tea room can be easily broken down and moved,

00:14:52.730 --> 00:14:56.360
gold is of no importance to him! He can build anything he wants!

00:14:57.630 --> 00:15:00.850
I, Furuta Oribe, have not admitted defeat!

00:15:15.820 --> 00:15:17.560
This dog has nice fur.

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:18.640
Lord Furuta!

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:21.060
Thank you for coming.

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:24.510
If war wasn't coming, I would have been able to come daily.

00:15:25.180 --> 00:15:27.650
This is Shinbei. I told you about him in my letter.

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:32.960
I am a silk merchant by trade, but I also dabble in bowls.

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:40.380
From the right - Shino, Crimson Shino, and Gray Shino.

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:46.230
We tried mixing some metallic dirt with the white foundation.

00:15:57.990 --> 00:15:59.080
Good job.

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:02.730
This is brilliant color, not seen even in China.

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:09.410
But this is not enough to surprise true aesthetes like me or the people in the capital.

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:14.020
If you want to make my libido rise far above the skies,

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:17.160
then you must draw a design on them!

00:16:20.820 --> 00:16:23.320
T-These are...

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:28.620
I tried drawing various famed treasures that move my heart.

00:16:28.890 --> 00:16:33.000
Hasegawa Tōhaku, the painter, then drew an example.

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:38.610
A true aesthete will not be able to refuse a drink while admiring the best scenery in the world!

00:16:41.090 --> 00:16:44.580
I don't want to dampen the party here,

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:50.090
but we lack the funds.

00:16:50.870 --> 00:16:55.060
We spent a lot of funds making those Shino bowls.

00:16:55.730 --> 00:16:58.360
Your funds alone are just not enough...

00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:02.300
Regarding that... Shinbei!

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:03.210
Here.

00:17:03.590 --> 00:17:07.280
I hear you are opening a store on Third Street in Kyoto.

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:14.620
Third Street is the place of the biggest market in the nation.

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:17.490
We cannot miss this big chance!

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:22.520
We will sell these tea bowls en masse at his store!

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:29.500
Shinbei's store will be our launching pad for our Mino goods to conquer the nation!

00:17:33.970 --> 00:17:36.510
A true aesthete does not need mere gold!

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:42.310
We will not fall into the trap Itami sake is in, trying to get a whole lot of value for a low price!

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:46.030
W-Well...

00:17:46.980 --> 00:17:49.880
I'm really sorry to interrupt your talk.

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:53.150
My store is called Setoya.

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:56.120
Please don't tarnish my name.

00:17:56.200 --> 00:18:06.120
My store links back to the Tokugawa name, and it is much more famous and trustworthy compared to the Mino name.

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:14.770
Did I lose to Oda yet again?

00:18:15.140 --> 00:18:17.400
Oh well. Who cares about that.

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:21.550
Please stay healthy.

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:25.810
Kanto is ruled by ferocious and fierce warriors.

00:18:26.280 --> 00:18:31.240
If anything should happen to you, then it'll be over for all of us.

00:18:31.800 --> 00:18:35.400
I know. I can't die now.

00:18:35.910 --> 00:18:42.140
Not until the Seto name is synonymous with tea bowls!

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:56.300
March, 1590 - Tōkaidō - Mishima

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:30.860
We're finally at Kanto.

00:19:31.550 --> 00:19:35.710
I hope all 200 of our troops can stay alive.

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:39.990
Asano Nagayoshi's 3,000 men have joined us.

00:19:40.380 --> 00:19:45.590
It seems like we are to attack Hōjō at multiple fronts.

00:19:46.710 --> 00:19:48.710
In any case, Kanto is underdeveloped.

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:52.530
We need to be careful or else we may get stuck.

00:19:52.590 --> 00:19:54.030
What!? A killing intent!?

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:56.410
It's dangerous! Stay down!

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:02.800
It's a fly.

00:20:03.460 --> 00:20:07.530
It's much smaller than the ones in Kyoto.

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:11.830
Too naive! You need to be careful of your surroundings at all times!

00:20:12.950 --> 00:20:16.500
I can't die. I won't die!

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:21.090
I must live to see the birth of the Seto name!

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:32.760
Maeda Uesugi Sanada's men number 35,000.

00:20:34.740 --> 00:20:38.480
Mōri Chōsokabe has 10,000 men in his navy.

00:20:39.820 --> 00:20:42.880
Tokugawa leads his 30,000 men.

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:53.830
And finally we have the Toyotomi army, 14,000 men.

00:20:54.220 --> 00:20:58.660
We will use these 200,000 plus men to bring peace to Kanto.

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:04.400
The Hōjō clan is inciting chaos for not coming to the capital.

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:09.700
It is our responsibility to kill over 70,000 of these traitors!

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:17.490
We will break through the mountains at Hakone first.

00:21:17.910 --> 00:21:21.810
Take down Yamanaka Castle and Nirayama Castle!

00:21:23.350 --> 00:21:27.800
At the same time, we surrounded Odawara Castle.

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:33.970
The Hokkoku army and the main army will hop from castle to castle in Kanto.

00:21:36.030 --> 00:21:42.330
Rikyū! I like the house of simplicity you built at Hōkō Temple.

00:21:44.370 --> 00:21:47.040
Thank you very much.

00:21:47.480 --> 00:21:50.810
My aesthetes! Do your jobs properly!

00:21:52.690 --> 00:21:56.890
Let the Hōjō clan see the difference in quality of our aesthetics!

00:22:10.150 --> 00:22:14.450
We cannot let Rikyū run buck wild, milord.

00:22:21.950 --> 00:22:25.030
If Hōjō is the cause of the chaos in this world,

00:22:25.870 --> 00:22:30.870
then the aesthetes are the instigators of chaos in the Toyotomi clan.

00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:37.570
My task as Jibunosho is to take care of them.

00:22:45.620 --> 00:22:50.960
I'm leaving you with all the secrets of my tea ceremony.

00:23:03.530 --> 00:23:06.260
Everytime I　

00:23:03.530 --> 00:23:06.260
Anata no mune

00:23:06.420 --> 00:23:08.650
feel your heart

00:23:06.420 --> 00:23:08.650
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.380 --> 00:23:14.740
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.380 --> 00:23:14.740
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:20.920
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:20.920
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:21.770 --> 00:23:27.080
Oppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:21.770 --> 00:23:27.080
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:33.170
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:33.170
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:37.050
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:37.050
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.280 --> 00:23:40.630
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.280 --> 00:23:40.630
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:40.830 --> 00:23:46.500
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:40.830 --> 00:23:46.500
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.600 --> 00:23:49.500
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.600 --> 00:23:49.500
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.580 --> 00:23:52.110
Without each other.

00:23:49.580 --> 00:23:52.110
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.200 --> 00:23:53.070
You should

00:23:52.200 --> 00:23:53.070
Soshite

00:23:53.160 --> 00:23:58.570
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.160 --> 00:23:58.570
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.680 --> 00:24:02.360
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.680 --> 00:24:02.360
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.420 --> 00:24:08.070
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.420 --> 00:24:08.070
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.150 --> 00:24:14.560
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.150 --> 00:24:14.560
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.620 --> 00:24:20.360
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.620 --> 00:24:20.360
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:21.840 --> 00:24:26.340
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:21.840 --> 00:24:26.340
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:34.150 --> 00:24:35.690
Give me a price.

00:24:39.270 --> 00:24:41.200
I cannot be looked down on!

00:24:45.010 --> 00:24:46.950
It's Lord Oribe! What should I do?

00:24:50.570 --> 00:24:52.750
Kanto Survival.

00:24:53.530 --> 00:24:58.240
To be a warrior or an aesthete? That is the question.

00:24:56.310 --> 00:24:59.600
Kanto Survival
